OL,3,ATrump to speak to Putin about plague
OL,4,Alab worker's death in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn response, Kremlin spokesman Dmitry
OL,7,FPeskov said no phone call had been
OL,8,Fscheduled, and Russia's reporting of
OL,9,Fthe death to the World Health
OL,10,FOrganization (WHO) was in line with
OL,11,Fstandard practice. He accused the media
OL,12,Fof reporting "false information".
OL,14,FThe US has issued a formal diplomatic
OL,15,Fmessage to Russia requesting additional
OL,16,Finformation. Peskov told reporters he
OL,17,Fwas not aware of such a request.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
